  "Choir of Doves <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Preparation Time: 4 Actions\\nIncrease party's DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> + $3 for every $2 points of Manaka's ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> DMG Dealt. Lasts for $5 turn. Manaka gains $6 [Holy Song] stacks.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>At the break of dawn, a flock of doves descended gracefully from the sky, their serene melodies transforming into an invisible force, like a divine blade bestowed with sacred prophecy.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Poem of Radiance Lv.$1": "",
  "Poem of Radiance <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Preparation Time: 4 Actions\\nRestore party's HP by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Manaka's ATK + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>, and cure 1 debuff. When Manaka has <link=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link>, spend 1 <link=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link> stack to decrease skill cooldown by 1 action, up to $3 actions. When Manaka manually uses this skill, increase healing by $4. \\nPassive: After Manaka gained $5 <link=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link> stacks, automatically activate the healing from this skill once.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Her lips part gently as ethereal songwaves ripple through the air, where luminous feathers touch, wounds are soothed, weariness and anguish swept away.</color></size></b>": "",
