  "Preparation Time: 4 Actions\\nIncrease party's ATK by $1 + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of Manaka's ATK. Spend all <link=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link>, for each <link=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link> stack spent, increase party's Pierce by $4 for every $3 points of Manaka's ATK, and ATK by $6 for every $5 points of Manaka's ATK. Lasts for $7 turns. (Up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color> points of ATK)\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The Wheel of Time slowly materializes, its rotating gears erupting with a flowing golden halo - this time-blessed sharpness can cleave through all stagnation.</color></size></b>": "",
