  "r:\"On each ally's action, gain (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Musical Note</u></link> stack, up to a maximum of (\\d+) stacks\\.\\nBefore any ally's action, Manaka can activate Da Capo \\(the initial use count in each battle is (\\d+)\\)\\. After activating Da Capo, when {{A}} takes (\\d+) actions other than additional actions, restore the use count by (\\d+) \\(this effect activates only (\\d+) time per battle\\)\\.\\nDa Capo: Remove (\\d+) debuff effect from (\\d+) ally\\. At the end of the target's next action, grant a special additional action\\. When in this state, the target's HP, SP, buff/debuff effects, and skill cooldowns are reset to their state at the start of the previous action\\.\"": "",
